    <summary type="text">I wrote about using homelab-pinchflat for at-home mashup creation and a song flow for church. But I use it for more than, that and here&#39;s another prime use case</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;I wrote about using &lt;a href=&#34;/homelab-pinchflat/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Homelab Pinchflat&#34; data-description=&#34;I&amp;#39;ve written about self-hosted-media before and addressed some thoughts with YouTube.&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-14&#34; data-preview=&#34;I&amp;#39;ve written about self-hosted-media before and addressed some thoughts with YouTube.&#34;&gt;Homelab Pinchflat&lt;/a&gt; for at-home mashup creation and a song flow&#xA;for church. But I use it for more than, that and here&amp;rsquo;s another prime use case&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There are podcasts on YouTube I want to follow - The Standup with Prime, or&#xA;Shawn Ryan&amp;rsquo;s show. Basically I use &lt;a href=&#34;/pinchflat/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;Pinchflat is a self-hostable YouTube media downloader&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;Pinchflat&#34;&gt;pinchflat&lt;/a&gt; to download the audio and serve up&#xA;those files in ABS (audiobookshelf)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content>
